# Timeline: events run in order. Images: PNG names in this directory;
# sounds: names here without extension, or a full romfs:/ path.
# Colors: RED BLUE GREEN YELLOW WHITE. "#" at line start = comment.
#
# IMAGE_LEFT|IMAGE_CENTER|IMAGE_RIGHT <image|NONE>
#                         top-screen slot; NONE empties it
# TEXT <color> <key>      bottom-screen text, typed out; adds to the
#                         previous text of the scene
# PAUSE <ms>              wait; 0 = until the player presses A
# SFX <name>              plays a .raw sound, doesn't wait
# MUSIC_START <name>      plays an .ogg music, continues across scenes
# MUSIC_STOP
# FULL_SCREEN ... END_FULL_SCREEN
#   SPRITE <image> <x> <y>  both screens, 320x480 (y >= 240: bottom),
#                           up to 16, later ones drawn on top
# END_SCENE               clears images, text and full-screen sprites
#
# Last line, required:
# END                     back to the title screen
# RETURN                  back to the room, which continues its action

SFX typing
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_1_BEGIN
PAUSE 2000
SFX loading
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_1_END
PAUSE 1000
SFX typing
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_2_BEGIN
PAUSE 2000
SFX loading
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_2_END
PAUSE 1000
SFX typing
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_3_BEGIN
PAUSE 2000
SFX loading
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_3_END
PAUSE 1000
SFX typing
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_4_BEGIN
PAUSE 2000
SFX loading
TEXT YELLOW TIMELINE_LINE_4_END
PAUSE 2000
END_SCENE
RETURN